  body: "# Conditions for self-employed business expenses\n\n## Authored interpretation\n\nThe captured
    passage conditions deduction of a business expense on business purpose, payment during the assessment
    period, reasonableness and allowability; mixed private and business use requires apportionment.\n\n\
    ## Scope and exceptions\n\nAn entry in business accounts is not proof that the whole amount is deductible.
    The separate allowable and excluded categories, evidence and circumstances need review. This is a
    JSA/IS source model, not tax advice or an assertion that HMRC and benefit expense rules are identical.\n\
    \n## Inspected source passages\n\n- [DMG 27190, PDF page 34](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e0f9e520b52e4144868939/dmg-Ch-27.pdf#page=34)
    — DMG Vol 5 Ch 27: Self-employed earners and share fishermen.\n- [DMG 27192, PDF page 34](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e0f9e520b52e4144868939/dmg-Ch-27.pdf#page=34)
    — DMG Vol 5 Ch 27: Self-employed earners and share fishermen.\n- [DMG 27194, PDF page 35](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e0f9e520b52e4144868939/dmg-Ch-27.pdf#page=35)
    — DMG Vol 5 Ch 27: Self-employed earners and share fishermen.\n\n## Evidence and review status\n\n\
    Model-assisted interpretation of selected passages in the 15 September 2026 frozen source snapshot.
    Specialist review is required. Source acquisition, source revision, legal effective dates and this
    record’s authoring time are separate.\n\nThis is an independent experimental publication, not an official
    DWP document, individual advice, an entitlement decision or an executable rule. Machine-extracted
    text may alter reading order, footnotes and characters. No PDF visual inspection, whole-chapter coverage
    or behavioural evaluation pass is claimed by this record.\n\n- `dmg-vol5-ch27`: PDF SHA-256 `90b6c5ec739d2366936d67d78cd5a6f857b764b92000200f4a44ac956c88b3ac`;
    extracted pages SHA-256 `7f84279f4a44373405ce06d32bf1c927a9f25dda507895b1540e6bb8b1b5185a`.\n"
